From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Leaves contributors <noreply@leavesmc.org>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 18:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Leaf performance fast paths

Port these opt-in fast paths from Leaf (https://github.com/Winds-Studio/Leaf):
- 0300: Skip firing GenericGameEvent if no listeners, by HaHaWTH <102713261+HaHaWTH@users.noreply.github.com>
- 0226: Skip BlockPhysicsEvent if no listeners, by Dreeam <61569423+Dreeam-qwq@users.noreply.github.com>
- 0310: Optimize chunk packet construction, by hayanesuru <hayanesuru@outlook.jp>
- 0293: Short-circuit InventoryChangeTrigger without listeners, by MrlingXD <90316914+wling-art@users.noreply.github.com>

Check the live event handler lists instead of using a per-tick snapshot.
Keep vanilla game-event delivery, Paper anti-xray and excess block-entity
handling, and the existing Cerulean hooks intact.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/advancements/triggers/InventoryChangeTrigger.java b/net/minecraft/advancements/triggers/InventoryChangeTrigger.java
index e9bfc239d47edc3708007b8d7da42297d49ad8d6..27c1adcb5e2a6067429974e39ea843386589fd55 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/advancements/triggers/InventoryChangeTrigger.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/advancements/triggers/InventoryChangeTrigger.java
@@ -39,6 +39,14 @@
             return;
         }
         // Leaves end - Cerulean
+        // Leaves start - Leaf: Skip inventory scan without advancement listeners
+        if (org.snowballmc.snowball.LeavesConfig.performance.skipInventoryChangeWithoutListeners) {
+            final var listeners = player.getAdvancements().getTriggerMapForType(this);
+            if (listeners == null || listeners.isEmpty()) {
+                return;
+            }
+        }
+        // Leaves end - Leaf: Skip inventory scan without advancement listeners
         int slotsFull = 0;
         int slotsEmpty = 0;
         int slotsOccupied = 0;
